  "result": {
    "summary": "The frozen shallow matched-control checkpoint completed eight independent 625-hand legacy-bridge greedy Slumbot sessions. All 5,000 raw hands, journals, learned-logit argmax actions, model SHA, terminal states, and disjoint token chains passed combined audit and independent review.",
